OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity reflects on its
OL,4,A150-year history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university has celebrated its 150th
OL,7,Fbirthday with a series of events and
OL,8,Fexhibitions and by remembering its
OL,9,Ffirst ever lecture - in maths.
OL,11,FThe very first lecture at University
OL,12,FCollege Bristol, which would go onto
OL,13,Fbecome the University of Bristol, took
OL,14,Fplace on 10 October 1876, with men and
OL,15,Fwomen admitted on the same basis.
OL,17,FProfessor Evelyn Welch, the
OL,18,Funiversity's pro-vice chancellor, said
OL,19,Fit was "amazing" to have an almost
OL,20,F50-50 gender split at a time when women
OL,21,Fhad almost no access to higher
OL,22,Feducation.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
