OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity reflects on its
OL,4,A150-year history
OL,5,
OL,6,FHighlights of the anniversary programme
OL,7,Finclude the second-ever showing of
OL,8,FPollenarium, an immersive artwork by
OL,9,FBristol artist Luke Jerram, and a talk
OL,10,Fwith renowned historian David Olusoga.
